{
  "about": "Every message of protocol version 2: version 1's, and the six ui/ messages version 2 adds. `sender` is who sends it. A `request` is answered; a `notice` is not. `uses` is the entry the tool's manifest must list in `uses` before the app will do it. `params` and `result` name a definition in messages.schema.json; null means the message carries none.",
